+ * two 2560x2880 tiles, the left by eDP on link 0 and the right by DP on
+ * link 1. The right tile's receiver, HPD and AUX respond only while the
+ * left tile's receiver is powered and its Apple-specific, undocumented DPCD
+ * register 0x4F1 is 1. Every DP_SET_POWER D3 write to the left tile clears
+ * the register.
+ */
+#define IMAC5K_DPCD_RIGHT_TILE_ENABLE 0x4F1
